{"id":"3d957024ea904a4db30839a728ea36d2","model":"gpt-oss-120b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"answer\": \"The Rescuers\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    [\"The Rescuers Down Under\", 1],\n    [\"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", 0]\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to answer: Which Walt Disney film was released earlier, The Rescuers or The Muppets? Need to compare release dates.\n\nEvidence: The Rescuers Down Under is 1990. But The Rescuers (original) is 1977, but not directly in evidence. However we have evidence that The Rescuers Down Under is a sequel to the 1977 animated film \"The Rescuers\". That indicates The Rescuers was released earlier (1977). The Muppets soundtrack is for the musical comedy film \"The Muppets\" released presumably 2011. Evidence: soundtrack released November 22, 2011 for the film \"The Muppets\". So The Rescuers (1977) earlier than The Muppets (2011). Answer: The Rescuers.\n\nWe need citations: For The Rescuers being 1977, we have sentence 1: \"The 29th Disney animated feature film, the film is the sequel to the 1977 animated film \\\"The Rescuers\\\"\". That indicates The Rescuers was 1977. Use that. For The Muppets release date, we have soundtrack release 2011, but need film release date. The evidence says soundtrack released November 22, 2011 for the musical comedy film \"The Muppets\". That implies film around 2011. Use that. So answer: The Rescuers.\n\nCitations: [\"The Rescuers Down Under\",1] for The Rescuers 1977. [\"The Muppets (soundtrack)\",0] for The Muppets 2011."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":612,"completion_tokens":397,"total_tokens":1009,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791981929,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}